OL,3,AThousands without power as Isaias
OL,4,Aprompts evacuation orders across Gulf
OL,5,ACoast
OL,6,
OL,7,FHurricane Isaias has made landfall near
OL,8,FDestin, Florida, on the US Gulf Coast
OL,9,Fas a category 2 storm
OL,11,FThe storm peaked as a category 3 but
OL,12,Fdowngraded as it approached the shore
OL,13,Fbringing with it a potentially deadly
OL,14,Fstorm surge
OL,16,FPeople on the coast of the Florida
OL,17,Fpanhandle have already been told to
OL,18,Fseek immediate shelter under an
OL,19,F"Extreme Wind Warning"
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
